        "@value": "by substituting for the word \"five\" the word \"ten\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Customs Act 1967, which in this Act is referred"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to as the \"principal Act\", is amended in subsection 2(1) by deleting the words \"in transit\" in the definition of \"inland clearance depot\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 3(3) of the principal Act is amended by"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "substituting for the word \"section\" the words \"sections 13B,\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "8 the following section: \"Minister 8A. The Minister may, by order published in may the Gazette, prescribe— prescribe uniforms, (a) uniforms and rank markings for any rank etc. of officers of customs; and (b) the authority card and badge to be carried by any rank of officers of customs.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 9 of the principal Act is amended—"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "(a) in subsections (1) and (2), by inserting before the words \"authority card\" the words \"badge or\"; (b) by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: \" (3) A badge or an authority card issued to an officer of customs shall be the property of the Government and shall be surrendered by such officer to the person appointed by the Director General for that purpose when such officer ceases to be an officer of customs or when instructed to do so.\"; and (c) in the marginal note, by substituting for the word \"Authority\" the words \"Badges and authority\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "9 the following section: \"Unlawful 9A. Any person, not being an officer of customs, use, who unlawfully wears, uses, possesses or possession, etc. of displays otherwise than in the course of a stage uniform, play or other theatrical performance, any etc. prescribed uniform or badge or authority card, or any dress having the appearance of or bearing the distinctive marks of such uniform shall be guilty of an offence under this Act.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 11 of the principal Act is amended by deleting"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "subsection (6)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_8__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_8__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "subsection 13(1) the following subsection: 13. 13. (1) The proper officer of customs may, in \"Classifi- cation and respect of any dutiable or uncustomed goods,— valuation by proper"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_8__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "determine the class of goods to which officer of customs. such dutiable or uncustomed goods belong; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_8__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "value, weigh, measure or otherwise examine, or cause to be valued, weighed, measured or otherwise examined such dutiable or uncustomed goods, CUSTOMS (AMENDMENT) for the purpose of ascertaining the customs duty leviable thereon.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "13 the following sections: \"Payment 13A. Any person who is dissatisfied with a of customs decision of a proper officer of customs under duty under section 13(1) as to whether any particular goods protest. are or are not included in a class of goods appearing in an order made under section 11(1) or with the valuation, weighing, measuring or examining of any goods may pay the customs duty levied under protest. Director 13B. Where customs duty has been paid under General to protest, the proper officer of customs shall, within determine thirty days of such payment being made, refer questions on classifi- any question as to classification or valuation cation and of goods to the Director General for his valuation. decision.\"."
      }
